**What changed**

| Issue | Fix |
|---|---|
| Hardcoded credentials / paths | `os.getenv` with sensible defaults (`DB_PATH`, `LOG_FILE`, `DB_HOST`, `DB_PORT`, `DB_USER`, `DB_PASS`) |
| SQL injection | Parameterized queries with `?` placeholders (`pipeline_refactored.py:195-206`) |
| Monolithic function | Split into `extract`, `transform`, `load`, `run_pipeline`, and `_write_report` |
| Fragile string splitting | Compiled regex patterns `_BASE_RE`, `_USER_RE`, `_API_RE` for structured parsing |
| No types or docs | Dataclasses for log entries, type hints on every function, docstrings with `Args`/`Returns` |

